# T-1140: Predicate pattern with a partial call expression.
# [starts-with? "foo"] in pattern position becomes [starts-with? "foo" scrutinee].
# The predicate returns Variant(Boolean.True), so the first arm matches.
[
  word: "foobar"
  result: [match word
    [starts-with? "foo"]: "yes"
    _:                    "no"]
]
---
%.result
=== out
String("yes")
